    </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          Floral, Dark plum, Pomelo, Earl g\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n          rey tea-like,\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n          Brown sugar\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          这款安西萨和胡安是一个庄园种植的果子，他们两都有埃塞豆的花香和肯尼亚的莓果调性，从当前的测试感受来看，安西萨可能更为的特别一些，它高温入口时有深色花朵的香气，带着成熟乌梅的果香浮现出来，酸质柔和且快速转甜，好似柚子的柑橘类水果的香气和酸感，中间还带着一些类似伯爵茶的茶香，喝完口腔中依然能感受到似红糖的回甘～甚至，我觉得它特别的瑰夏，或者说超越一些常规的瑰夏的细腻酸甜和风味的辨识度～LOL喜欢\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TmDA6U4icjBXfcgmYBOFzM7HnZiakByfFuib0L9cedUNsWTHrnyb22IIJRUaWmGRmSXFicNO0eoq7bfA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          胡安（左）安西撒（中）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: 600;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;'>\n          关于胡安与他的翡翠\n         </span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          安西萨的庄园名叫La Esmeralda（意为翡翠），他是Urrego家的大哥，今年65岁，生在长在乌劳，一辈子都在做咖农。大约五年前经朋友推荐种下了一个奇罗索地块，因为见长势良好，挂果率高，于是就种开了这个树种。因为精品咖啡的种植可以带来相对较高的收入，因此安西萨决定将品质作为主要努力方向。安西萨家的庄园位于海拔很高的位置，1950往上，因此非常冷。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TmDA6U4icjBXfcgmYBOFzM7qqE9wEe6AXojYltPPiaOH9nt4M4qyChzpgIrFjrBZzGiboU9zliclL9Ag/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          笑呵呵的安西萨：）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于Chiroso\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          奇罗索（Chiroso）在哥伦比亚当地因其咖啡树的叶子呈现锯齿半开合状而得名（Chiroso意为参差不齐），它最早被发现于哥伦比亚的安蒂奥基亚（Antioquia）地区，起初因为它身形近似卡杜拉，被当地种植者误认为是在哥伦比亚的卡杜拉自然变种，但近年文献表明奇洛索是埃塞的原生种。在当地奇罗索有两种，一种是卡杜拉奇罗索，一种是波旁奇罗索，前者树形较矮，后者较高，是两种不同的树种，在近年在逐渐区分，在早年他们都统称为奇罗索；2014年，Carmen Cecilia Montoya以91.31分的成绩为她种植的Caturra Chiroso赢得了COE第一名；2020年，费利佩·赫诺·特里亚纳又以波旁·奇罗索90.03分获得COE第一名；奇洛索在近30多年来都备受种植者和市场的喜爱。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TmDA6U4icjBXfcgmYBOFzM7sJDlPiaTdDRRHEEZN7exjaicMic40tVkUoBgicqWibPe9Cg4q3ZAoRP49Jg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          Caturra Chiroso(左-矮一点但是胖一点）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          Bourbon Chiroso （右-高一点苗条一点）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          拍摄于阿贝罗小农家\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于这个批次的处理\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: left;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          这里的正常发酵要持续72小时才可使果胶失去黏性，之后洗去果胶，在晒架上晾晒30天左右。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;outline: 0px;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
